# Camera & scenes

- **Bootstrap (Root):** Startup, GameAudio, GameInput, GameSession, one Main Camera (+ AudioListener), EventSystem. No menu canvas, no gameplay light/world.
- **MainMenu:** splash/menu canvases + `PressAnyKeyScreen` / `MainMenuScreen`. No Main Camera.
- **Loading:** transition while Game loads. Include in Build list.
- **Game:** level, lights, VCams, Simulation SubScene. No second Main Camera (Cinemachine Brain on Root).
- Cinemachine package: add when implementing VCams; until then Game may temporarily keep its camera (mark temporary).

